    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Partners O'Brien Swaine are delighted to bring this Beautiful 3-Bedroom Semi-Detached Home in the Highly Sought-After Hazelwood Estate to the market \n\nPresented in turnkey condition, this superb 3-bedroom semi-detached home is located in the ever-popular Hazelwood estate and offers bright, spacious accommodation finished to an excellent standard throughout.\n\nBuilt in 2000, the property is ideal for first-time buyers, growing families, or those looking to downsize without compromising on space or comfort.\n\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a separate fully fitted kitchen, a spacious open-plan living and dining room with open Fire Place with patio doors leading to the rear garden, and a convenient guest WC. Upstairs are three generously sized bedrooms, two of which feature built-in wardrobes, along with a family bathroom.\n\nThe private rear garden has been designed for low maintenance, with a combination of paving and decorative pebbles, making it the perfect space for outdoor dining or relaxing. An Adman storage shed provides excellent additional storage. To the front, the property enjoys a lawned garden and off-street parking for two cars.\n\nFurther enhancing the home are a recently installed condenser boiler and a new front door, offering improved energy efficiency and peace of mind for the new owners.\n\nSituated in the highly desirable Hazelwood estate, this fantastic home is within easy reach of schools, shops, local amenities, and excellent transport links, making it an outstanding opportunity to purchase a move-in-ready home in a prime residential location.\n\nServices \nMains Services"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Beautifully presented throughout\nHighly sought-after Hazelwood estate\n3 spacious bedrooms\nSeparate fitted kitchen\nBright open-plan living/dining room\nGuest WC\nAlarm System\nOil fired Central Heating \nBuilt-in wardrobes in two bedrooms\nPrivate, low-maintenance rear garden\nAdman garden shed included( Approx 3m x 5.2m)\nOff-street parking for two cars\nNew condenser boiler\nNew front door\nBuilt in 2000\nTurnkey condition\n\n"
      },
